    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Black Mud} to begin quest. You will obtain a {i:Brass Canteen|Brass Canteen|493}.
** If you have the {p:Proto-Waypoint} warp to {z:North Gustaberg}, it will take you almost directly to the **Waterfall Base**. (From there, walk east and across the bridge to the north.)
* Otherwise, travel to {z:Dangruf Wadi} and head north from the entrance.
** The quickest method is via {p:Survival Guide}, otherwise zone in from {z:South Gustaberg} (D-9).
** {s:Invisible} or {i:Prism Powders|Prism Powder|4164} are recommended, as there are aggressive level 90 Goblins along the way.
* Once inside {z:Dangruf Wadi}, travel to (I-8) and go up the geyser by standing on top of it until being shot up the ledge.
* Head northeast to (J-3) and go up a second geyser.
* Continue following this path to zone out into {z:North Gustaberg}
* Travel east and cross the bridge.
** Pick up the {p:Geomagnetic Fount} here if you do not have the Proto-Waypoint warp yet.
* Continue following the river towards the base of the waterfall.
* Locate the **Waterfall Base** and trade the {i:Brass Canteen|Brass Canteen|493} to it to receive {i:Drachenfall Water|Drachenfall Water|492}.
** There is a **???** nearby. It is for unlocking the relic weapon {p:Apocalypse}, not for this quest.
* Return to Bastok and trade the {i:Drachenfall Water|Drachenfall Water|492} to {n:Black Mud} to complete the quest.

=2 Notes
* There is a headstone for the quest {q:An Explorer's Footsteps|An Explorer's Footsteps|An Explorer's Footsteps} along the way. You may wish to complete that at the same time.

